ool returned result: {'result': None}\nMessage 2:\n  ID: f24f7d40-96b5-4e85-ae01-9cfad5f69dab\n  Role: Role.user\n  Task ID: ade7b283-1883-4f58-917c-70345d94cbec\n  Context ID: 13acd198-5a68-4788-8bbc-0dbd9ae19df2\n  Message Parts:\n  Part 0: TextPart: search how to treat migrained latest\n  Part 1: TextPart: For context:\n  Part 2: TextPart: [receptionist] called tool `transfer_to_agent` with parameters: {'agent_name': 'Neurologist'}\n  Part 3: TextPart: For context:\n  Part 4: TextPart: [receptionist] `transfer_to_agent` tool returned result: {'result': None}\nMessage 3:\n  ID: 5df65b30-5bf2-49d7-b14e-389182049b33\n  Role: Role.agent\n  Task ID: None\n  Context ID: None\n  Message Parts:\n  Part 0: DataPart: {\n      \"id\": \"adk-a1a60ab6-1201-4a2b-b1fd-bd50c63f1fe4\",\n      \"args\": {\n        \"request\": \"latest clinical guidelines for migraine treatment\"\n      },\n      \"name\": \"search_agent\"\n    }\n        Part Metadata: {\n          \"adk_type\": \"function_call\",\n          \"adk_thought_signature\": \"\"\n        }\nMessage 4:\n  ID: 27811857-1a11-47dc-a06c-dc6e6c0c82d2\n  Role: Role.agent\n  Task ID: None\n  Context ID: None\n  Message Parts:\n  Part 0: DataPart: {\n      \"id\": \"adk-a1a60ab6-1201-4a2b-b1fd-bd50c63f1fe4\",\n      \"name\": \"search_agent\",\n      \"response\": \"<dict>\"\n    }\n        Part Metadata: {\n          \"adk_type\": \"function_response\"\n        }\nMessage 5:\n  ID: 80e05458-28c0-4cd9-88d8-9bd7c3fee0a1\n  Role: Role.agent\n  Task ID: None\n  Context ID: None\n  Message Parts:\n  Part 0: TextPart: Hello, I am the Neurologist. I understand you're asking about the latest approaches to treating migr...\n-----------------------------------------------------------\n"}
